<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no">
<title>卤炸帮 · 牛货系列 · 咔库秘制</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;background:#1a1410;color:#e8ddd0;padding:24px 16px;line-height:1.7}
.card{max-width:540px;margin:0 auto;background:#231e18;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
.meta{padding:20px 22px 14px;background:#2a221b;border-bottom:1px solid #3a3026}
.meta .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#c0392b;background:#3a1e1c;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:6px}
.meta h1{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#f0d6b0;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2px}
.meta .sub{font-size:12px;color:#8a7a6a;margin-bottom:10px}
.meta .tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.meta .tags span{font-size:10px;padding:2px 10px;background:#3a3026;border-radius:12px;color:#c0a892}
.level-banner{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:#2a221b;border-bottom:1px solid #3a3026;flex-wrap:wrap}
.level-item{font-size:11px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#3a3026;color:#c0a892}
.level-item.high{background:#c0392b;color:#fff}
.section{padding:14px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #3a3026}
.s-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#f0d6b0;margin-bottom:10px;padding-bottom:4px;border-bottom:2px solid #3a3026}
.story{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#c0a892}
.story em{color:#c0392b;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}
.cost-box{padding:12px 14px;background:#2a221b;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;padding:4px 0;color:#c0a892}
.row .v{font-weight:600;color:#f0d6b0}
.row.tot{border-top:1px solid #3a3026;margin-top:4px;padding-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#c0392b}
.roi{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}
.roi-b{flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#c0a892}
.roi-b .d{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:2px 0}
.roi-b.c{background:#3a2e1c;color:#c0392b}
.roi-b.n{background:#2a3026;color:#8ab87a}
.roi-b.i{background:#1e2a2a;color:#5ab8b8}
.timing-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.timing-row{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:6px 10px;background:#2a221b;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#c0a892}
.timing-row .name{width:48px;font-weight:700;color:#f0d6b0;flex-shrink:0}
.timing-row .steps{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-left:8px}
.timing-row .steps span{padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}
.timing-row .steps .lu{background:#4a2a1a;color:#c0392b}
.timing-row .steps .men{background:#2a3a2a;color:#8ab87a}
.timing-row .steps .zha{background:#3a1a1a;color:#f07850}
.process-list{padding:0}
.process-item{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:6px 0;font-size:12px;color:#c0a892;border-bottom:1px solid #2a221b}
.process-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.process-item .step-num{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#4a3a2a;color:#c0392b;text-align:center;line-height:20px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}
.process-item .step-text{flex:1}
.talk{background:#2a221b;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:#c0a892;line-height:1.8}
.alert{background:#3a1e1c;border-left:3px solid #c0392b;padding:8px 12px;font-size:10px;color:#c0392b;margin-top:6px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0}
.paywall{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2a221b,#1e1a14);border:1.5px dashed #4a3a2a;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin:14px 22px;text-align:center}
.paywall .price{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#c0392b}
.paywall .desc{font-size:11px;color:#8a7a6a;margin:4px 0 12px}
.paywall .btn{display:inline-block;background:#c0392b;color:#fff;padding:8px 28px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:.2s}
.footer{text-align:center;padding:16px 22px;font-size:10px;color:#6a5a4a}
.footer .brand{font-size:11px;color:#8a7a6a;font-weight:600}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">LZ_004 · 咔库秘制</div>
  <h1>卤炸帮 · 牛货系列</h1>
  <div class="sub">先卤后炸 · 一身牛气 · 下酒硬菜</div>
  <div class="tags"><span>#卤炸帮</span><span>#牛系列</span><span>#牛肉</span><span>#牛板筋</span><span>#牛肚</span></div>
</div>
<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">🔥 利润担当</span>
  <span class="level-item">毛利率 45-55%</span>
  <span class="level-item">7种牛货出品</span>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">📖 产品说</div>
  <div class="story">
    牛肉系列是卤炸的<em>利润王者</em>。牛肉、牛筋、牛百叶、牛头肉、牛板筋、牛肚、牛心——先以川香辣卤水小火卤透，关火焖至入味，再下油锅炸至表皮微焦，撒上秘制干料。全牛宴一锅出，卤香浸润、焦香四溢，夜市下酒硬菜。<br><br>
    牛肉慢卤，牛肚快出——不同部位的卤焖时间差异很大，核心是<em>分批卤制</em>：先下牛肉牛筋牛板筋，中段下牛心牛头肉，最后卤牛肚牛百叶。焖的时间决定口感——牛肚焖太久会烂糊，牛板筋不焖透嚼不动。<br><br>
    按牛肉计，单份成本约¥25，售价¥45-55，毛利率约45-55%，单品利润远超鸭货。牛筋牛板筋当小份卖，利润更高。
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">⏱ 各食材卤制/炸制时间表</div>
  <div class="timing-grid">
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">牛肉</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤80min</span><span class="men">焖60min</span><span class="zha">炸2min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">牛筋</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤70min</span><span class="men">焖30min</span><span class="zha">炸1.5min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">牛百叶</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤70min</span><span class="men">焖30min</span><span class="zha">炸1min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">牛头肉</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤70min</span><span class="men">焖60min</span><span class="zha">炸1.5min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">牛板筋</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤90min</span><span class="men">焖60min</span><span class="zha">炸1.5min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">牛肚</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤15min</span><span class="men">焖20min</span><span class="zha">炸1min</span></div></div>
    <div class="timing-row"><span class="name">牛心</span><div class="steps"><span class="lu">卤55min</span><span class="men">焖60min</span><span class="zha">炸1.5min</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="alert" style="margin-top:8px">💡 卤制顺序：牛肉→牛板筋（先下锅）→牛筋/牛头肉/牛心（中段）→牛肚/牛百叶（后下锅），统一关火焖制</div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">📋 工艺</div>
  <div class="process-list">
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">1</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">出水：</strong>冷水下锅+葱姜料酒，煮至变色捞出冲凉。牛肉牛板筋多煮5分钟去血沫</span></div>
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">2</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">卤制：</strong>共用川香辣卤水，按时间表分批下锅小火卤</span></div>
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">3</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">焖制：</strong>关火后按时间表焖，牛肉牛板筋焖足60分钟才耙软</span></div>
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">4</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">炸制（可选）：</strong>油温170-180℃，炸至表皮微焦，牛肉切厚片炸更香</span></div>
    <div class="process-item"><span class="step-num">5</span><span class="step-text"><strong style="color:#f0d6b0">撒料：</strong>共用卤炸干料，撒匀趁热出餐。牛肉切薄片/牛筋切段/牛板筋撕条，口感最佳</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">💰 成本利润（按牛肉计）</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>单份成本</span><span class="v">¥25</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>售价区间</span><span class="v">¥45-55/份</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>毛利率</span><span class="v">45-55%</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>夜市日销</span><span class="v">30-50份</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日营收</span><span class="v">≈¥1,350-2,750</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>原料成本</span><span class="v">≈¥750-1,250</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>摊位+杂费</span><span class="v">~¥100-180</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>日净赚</span><span class="v">≈¥500-1,320</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div class="d">4-6天</div>保守</div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div class="d">2-4天</div>正常</div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div class="d">1-2天</div>理想</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">💬 话术</div>
  <div class="talk">「卤炸全牛宴——牛气冲天！牛肉耙软、牛筋Q弹、牛板筋嚼劲十足，一锅出7样！」<br>「先卤后炸，外焦里嫩，配冰啤酒绝配。」</div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">📋 工艺流程（详细版）</div>
  <div class="story">• 牛肉牛板筋改刀大块（卤后切片），牛肚牛百叶洗净，牛筋切段<br>• 冷水下锅加葱姜料酒，煮至变色捞出冲凉（牛肉牛板筋多煮5分钟去血沫）<br>• 川香辣卤水烧开，先下牛肉→牛板筋，中段下牛筋/牛头肉/牛心，后下牛肚/牛百叶<br>• 全部下齐后小火保持微沸，关火按时间表焖（牛肉牛板筋焖足60分钟）<br>• 焖好后分部位捞出，晾至表面微干（不晾干炸不酥）<br>• 油温170-180℃，按时间表炸至表皮微焦<br>• 牛肉切薄片、牛筋切段、牛板筋撕条，撒秘制卤炸干料<br>• 按份装袋出餐，建议混搭（牛肉+牛筋+牛百叶），客单价更高</div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">🚫 避坑</div>
  <div class="story">• <em>卤制顺序搞错</em>——牛肉牛板筋需要长时间卤焖，牛肚牛百叶几分钟就行。一定要分批下锅，一次性全下牛肚就烂了。<br>• <em>牛板筋焖不够</em>——牛板筋卤90分钟+焖60分钟是底线，少一分钟都嚼不动。<br>• <em>炸太久</em>——牛肉炸2分钟表皮微焦就够，炸干口感变柴，白瞎了好牛肉。<br>• <em>不晾干就炸</em>——卤完捞出表面带水分，直接下锅不仅溅油，表皮也炸不酥。<br>• <em>牛肉切太薄</em>——卤前切太小块容易散，建议大块卤后切薄片，炸制时厚片更香。<br>• <em>牛百叶别炸太久</em>——1分钟足够，过头缩水还发硬。</div>
</div>
